KAG — Kinetic Action Gateway

KAG was originally developed by Mike Storm in a private repository, as an
independent project that grew out of his KIL work, and brought into the
open here with his authorship preserved. Hosting the code in this repository
records that fact; it does not transfer it.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

KAG implements the Kinetic Trust Protocol, published by NMCITRA under the
Apache License 2.0: https://github.com/nmcitra/ktp-rfc
Canonical citation: https://github.com/nmcitra/ktp-rfc/blob/main/CITATION.cff
